{{sc|Priestess|You seem a bit down, {nickname}.<br/>Care to share the reason with me?}}
{{sc|Oracle|QHU9112, another fading star system.<br/>It's a new high tide. What surrounds us is merely the first wave, It's arriving much faster than we anticipated.<br/>We don't have much time left...}}
{{sc|Priestess|But we're prepared, yes?<br/>We've planted a seed of hope, and now we need only wait for it to grow a solution.<br/>Don't fret. Treat it as a regular hibernation. No different than prior time travels, just a little longer.<br/>And this time, I will be there by your side.<br/>I hope after crossing the quiet, endless night, the first thing I see when awake is you.}}
{{sc|Oracle|We still haven't figured out a solution from our debates...<br/>Originium is our last hope, and we have few alternatives. We must think twice before we choose our path.}}
