{{sc|Priestess gently holds the hand of the person by her side.<br/>She does not speak her thoughts, but they transform into images within this mind-resonance room—visuals symbolizing happiness and hope.<br/>Her gaze is sincere and clear.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|Priestess|I've never forgotten our matter of debate, {nickname}. We shouldn't hold any reservations towards each other.<br/>Look, this is in fact my mindset when we discuss our future. We should harbor the same set of expectations.<br/>The identical lynchpins embedded in our minds are what tie us together.<br/>Our minds are inseparably linked, until our consciousnesses follow suit with the universe's demise.<br/>We do clash and argue endlessly, but that is precisely the reason why we most understand each other's disposition.<br/>I know for certain it is in our nature to harbor hope for the future. We serve as anchors for one another in this hollow sea of stars.}}
{{sc|Oracle|Even if we can't agree on our differing views on Originium? Our planned paths for it can't coexist...<br/>Priestess, I'm not sure...}}
{{sc|Priestess|Then let's continue to wait.<br/>It's fine if you're not willing to hibernate yet. We still have some time.<br/>We can read the classics stored inside DWDB together, or interpret the many verses left by dead planets in this universe.<br/>Before you make up your mind, I'll never force you—<br/>I'll never impose my own will on yours.<br/>I'll wait, {nickname}, until you make the choice to stand by my side.}}
{{sc|Oracle|Priestess...}}
{{sc|Priestess|Take it easy, {nickname}. Your recent observations must have exhausted you.<br/>Close your eyes and rest a while. I'll play you a chord on the gravitational forces of distant stars, and you'll enjoy a sweet dream.}}
